$ ls -l lane-tmp/.ufo/evidence/round-96/c1/pins.json.tmp-pins
lrwxrwxrwx 1 vgpnk vgpnk 57 Nov  8 09:25 lane-tmp/.ufo/evidence/round-96/c1/pins.json.tmp-pins -> /fast/scratch/hyaku/tameshi-r96/R96E3/tmp-out/victim.json

exit 2, victim sha256 identical before and after, destination untouched, symlink not followed and not deleted. The tmp guard is the same lexists/islink pair, so the O_EXCL open cannot be redirected through a planted link, and O_NOFOLLOW is set on the tmp open as a second line.

